%% Argus configuration (Erlang terms), read from the repo root when CI runs
%% the escript on the build's beams. See CONTRIBUTING.md.

%% "Lock during init" (argus.startup): the first NIF call loads the NIF under
%% a :global.trans lock, and Server.init/1 and Distributed.Client.init/1 make
%% NIF calls. The lock is node-local and only taken until the NIF is loaded,
%% after which a :persistent_term check skips it. A file ignore hides only
%% findings reported in native.ex; its facts still feed every other analysis.
{ignore, [{files, ["lib/ex_ratatui/native.ex"]}]}.
